{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202655SjUwOd021793593537.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>財經事務及庫務局局長許正宇在金融科技周表示，不法分子利用人工智能及深偽技術，製作虛假投資廣告的情況增加。政府將於今年內展開市場諮詢，研究立法偵測並移除相關廣告。</p><p></p><p>財經事務及庫務局局長許正宇說︰「當局正展開研究，審視相關潛在風險及緩減措施，以應對這個新趨勢。同時政府將於今年內盡快諮詢市場，研究如何制定法律框架，確保能及早偵測並移除這類深偽廣告等資訊，保障投資者免受誤導。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:12.045540+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:44.488129+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:58:05.547166+00:00","content_hash":"24027e9798f9b16698eb5dcc1c47f213cd9327eb123e2393e6bf48d85b3419bc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:12.045540+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}